# Anti-Hang Stable Hook Interface

Semantic owner: CURRENT `ANTI_HANG_RUNTIME`.
Executable source: `true-memory/runtime/anti_hang_kernel.py` and mirrored plugin `scripts/runtime_kernel.py`.

Preferred call:
`hook(event, **state)`.

Events:
`TASK_ENTRY | BEFORE_ACTION | AFTER_ACTION | AFTER_MATERIAL_RETURN | PRESSURE | BEFORE_USER_RETURN | USER_STOP`.

Implementation primitives remain subordinate to the hook interface:
`replay_gate | before_action_gate | execution_admission | effect_transition | runnable_scan | record_observation | reconcile_eligibility | return_gate | pressure_policy`.

Correctness is behavioral:
- never blind-replay ambiguous consequential effects;
- never hide risky preparation + consequential write + readback in one opaque composite;
- existing healthy host-controlled calls, including reads and recovery, retain the legacy no-profile shape (`execution_scope=HOST_CONTROLLED`) without a qualified host-deadline claim;
- ND-owned/actually qualified boundaries require an enforced request profile and deadline owner; explicit opaque risk or missing/invalid owned evidence denies/routes to recovery, never silent host fallback;
- owned/qualified durable async separates bounded submit acknowledgment from job completion; a missing consequential ack remains OUTCOME_UNKNOWN without blind replay;
- nonterminal effect blocks only dependent frontier;
- each status read consumes one actual observation bound to effect and generation, after other admission checks; reused tokens or wake/follow-up booleans cannot grant another read;
- verified result-ready returns to the owner before nonessential cleanup; readiness does not itself establish remote terminal state or semantic completion;
- every material/action return on an active branch re-enters root;
- pressure rotates/narrows active safe cycles and auto-continues; explicit/durable Stop dominates every valid hook, including PRESSURE;
- user-visible global return is allowed only at completion, explicit Stop, true gate, or proven external quiescence;
- Stop permits interrupted/incomplete coverage with retained diagnostics, no fabricated AFTER_ACTION or new repair calls; late results cannot reopen the stopped generation and Stop does not prove remote cancellation;
- the existing effect owner records/preserves a nonnull Stop timestamp for that generation: assign when the nullable field is None and retain any existing earliest nonnull value. A pure kernel Stop verdict does not write storage.

Profile evidence and the mirrored kernel do not install ChatGPT/MCP host deadlines, interruptibility, autonomous wake or a fresh assistant turn. An owned adapter enforces a local request boundary only where actually wired; fixture qualification is not host transport qualification. No persistence layer, actor or controller is added here.

Task decomposition, cognitive hooks, memory lifecycle, route strategy and message rendering are outside Anti-Hang ownership.

